  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: e6c42dac352e3154aac8417ba59e92ab, type: 3}
  m_Name: Event_MorningIntimacy
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Edenfall.Runtime::Edenfall.Events.MatureEventDefinition
  eventId: evt_aurelia_morning_intimacy
  titleVi: "Kho\u1EA3nh Kh\u1EAFc Th\xE2n M\u1EADt B\xEAn N\xE0ng Aurelia"
  titleEn: Morning Intimacy with Aurelia
  characterId: aurelia
  summaryVi: "Kho\u1EA3nh kh\u1EAFc ng\u1ECDt ng\xE0o b\xEAn Aurelia t\u1EA1i ph\xF2ng
    ngh\u1EC9 ri\xEAng t\u01B0 d\u01B0\u1EDBi \xE1nh n\u1EAFng s\u01B0\u01A1ng mai
    r\u1EF1c r\u1EE1."
  summaryEn: A sweet, intimate morning shared with Aurelia in her private sanctuary
    chamber.
  minAffection: 35
  minTrust: 30
  minComfort: 25
  requiredLocationId: loc_aurelia_chamber
  requiredTimeOfDay: 0
  anyTimeOfDay: 1
  bonusAffection: 20
  bonusTrust: 15
  bonusComfort: 20
  memoryRecordVi: "\u0110\xE3 tr\u1EA3i qua kho\u1EA3nh kh\u1EAFc th\xE2n m\u1EADt
    ri\xEAng t\u01B0 c\xF9ng Aurelia trong s\u01B0\u01A1ng mai."
  memoryRecordEn: Shared an intimate private morning memory with Aurelia in her chamber.
  mainCGSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 0530f62400346ad458bd3cacae734a02, type: 3}
  slides:
  - characterEmotion: 1
    narrationVi: "\xC1nh n\u1EAFng ban mai r\u1ECDi qua v\xF2m c\u1ED9t \u0111\xE1
      c\u1EA9m th\u1EA1ch tr\u1EAFng, nhu\u1ED9m v\xE0ng nh\u1EEFng c\xE1nh hoa t\u1EED
      \u0111\u1EB1ng \u0111ang \u0111ung \u0111\u01B0a trong gi\xF3 tho\u1EA3ng.
      Aurelia t\u1EF1a m\xECnh tr\xEAn chi\u1EBFc gi\u01B0\u1EDDng l\u1EE5a \xEAm
      \xE1i, ng\u01B0\u1EDBc m\u1EAFt nh\xECn b\u1EA1n v\u1EDBi n\u1EE5 c\u01B0\u1EDDi
      d\u1ECBu d\xE0ng."
    narrationEn: Gentle morning sunbeams filter through classical marble archways,
      illuminating purple wisteria petals. Aurelia rests softly upon the silk bed,
      gazing up at you with an intimate, radiant smile.
    dialogueVi: "Ch\xE0o bu\u1ED5i s\xE1ng, ng\u01B0\u1EDDi th\u01B0\u01A1ng c\u1EE7a
      ta... Ng\u01B0\u01A1i \u0111\xE3 th\u1EE9c gi\u1EA5c r\u1ED3i sao? Ta c\u1EE9
      ng\u1EE1 ng\u01B0\u01A1i v\u1EABn c\xF2n \u0111ang ch\xECm trong gi\u1EA5c
      m\u01A1 v\u1EC1 v\xF9ng \u0111\u1EA5t v\u1EE1 v\u1EE5n n\xE0y."
    dialogueEn: Good morning, my sweet... Are you finally awake? I thought you were
      still lost in dreams of this shattered world.
    cameraEffect: 1
    isFadeToBlack: 0
    slideCG: {fileID: 0}
  - characterEmotion: 2
    narrationVi: "\u0110\xF4i m\xE1 n\xE0ng ph\u01A1n ph\u1EDBt \u1EEDng h\u1ED3ng.
      N\xE0ng kh\u1EBD \u0111\u01B0a b\xE0n tay thon th\u1EA3 v\u1EC1 ph\xEDa b\u1EA1n,
      t\u1EEBng \u0111\u1EA7u ng\xF3n tay l\u1EA5p l\xE1nh b\u1EE5i tinh t\xFA \u1EA5m
      \xE1p."
    narrationEn: A delicate rose blush warms her cheeks. She extends a graceful hand
      toward you, her fingertips glowing with warm celestial light.
    dialogueVi: "H\xE3y l\u1EA1i g\u1EA7n \u0111\xE2y... Ch\u1EC9 c\u1EA7n c\xF3
      ng\u01B0\u01A1i k\u1EC1 b\xEAn, g\xE1nh n\u1EB7ng c\u1EE7a d\xF2ng d\xF5i H\u1EA1
      Ch\xED d\u01B0\u1EDDng nh\u01B0 tan bi\u1EBFn v\xE0o h\u01B0 v\xF4."
    dialogueEn: Come closer... As long as you are by my side, the weight of the Solstice
      bloodline feels lighter than air.
    cameraEffect: 3
    isFadeToBlack: 0
    slideCG: {fileID: 0}
  - characterEmotion: 11
    narrationVi: "C\u0103n ph\xF2ng ng\u1EADp tr\xE0n h\u01A1i th\u1EDF \u1EA5m \xE1p
      v\xE0 h\u01B0\u01A1ng hoa ly thanh tao. Kho\u1EA3nh kh\u1EAFc hai tr\xE1i tim
      h\xF2a chung nh\u1ECBp \u0111\u1EADp d\u01B0\u1EDBi \xE1nh m\u1EB7t tr\u1EDDi
      r\u1EA1ng \u0111\xF4ng."
    narrationEn: The chamber fills with gentle warmth and the delicate fragrance
      of lilies. A private vow shared between two souls beneath the morning sun.
    dialogueVi: "Ta y\xEAu ng\u01B0\u01A1i... H\xE3y m\xE3i l\xE0 v\u1EA7ng th\xE1i
      d\u01B0\u01A1ng c\u1EE7a ri\xEAng ta, Echo nh\xE9."
    dialogueEn: I love you... Please remain my own personal sun forever, Echo.
    cameraEffect: 4
    isFadeToBlack: 1
    slideCG: {fileID: 0}
